# Take off to a target altitude and hold there.
#
# Accepted from IDLE while disarmed with valid telemetry. mullet_core sequences warmup,
# Offboard, arm, and ascent internally (TRANSITION, active_action "takeoff") and succeeds
# once the vehicle has settled at the target, in HOLD. Cancelable; a cancel is handled like
# Land: before the arm request the vehicle returns to IDLE, after it the vehicle lands.
float32 altitude_m     # Target altitude above the takeoff point, metres. Rejected outside
                       # mullet_core's [min_takeoff_altitude_m, max_takeoff_altitude_m].
float32 yaw_rad        # Target heading, radians. Must be finite when use_current_yaw is false.
bool use_current_yaw   # True holds the heading the vehicle had at takeoff and ignores yaw_rad.
---
bool success
string message
---
string state
float32 current_altitude_m
float32 target_altitude_m
float32 altitude_error_m
float32 progress       # 0.0 to 1.0 toward the target altitude.
